  "description": "They say opposites attract. Let's see it! She's a naive country girl, playful and affectionate like a dog. He's a brooding actor, haughty and reserved like a cat. The two were arranged to be married as kids, and now it's time to start their life together. Will they be able to overcome their differences and find love?\n\n(Source: Manta)",
